        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Gareth Evans, Michael Winner\n- Works: The Raid, The Raid 2\n- Roles: film director, screenwriter, film editor, action choreographer, producer, restaurant critic\n- Places: Wales, England\n\nFacts:\n- Michael Winner was born on 30 October 1935 and died on 21 January 2013.\n- Gareth Huw Evans was born in 1980.\n- Gareth Evans is a Welsh film director, screenwriter, film editor, and action choreographer.\n- Michael Winner was an English film director and producer, and he was a restaurant critic for The Sunday Times.\n- The Raid was released in 2011.\n- The Raid 2 is the sequel to Gareth Evans's 2011 film The Raid.",
